 migration, provider-field removal, and committed-input provenance. Field-name changes do not prove source-file path renames; the passive census establishes only that no such events occurred in its stated interval. Neither deployed HTTP serving nor all84/native/fullGo/P17 is established as a dependency of this decision. The 54 pre-existing metadata mismatches do not independently establish an affected-transition defect. This is a Source gate decision, not a claim of a demonstrated runtime regression. Distinct Reader+Quality decisions and persisted evidence/registration with verified commit/push remain necessary for formal acceptance.\",\"overall_confidence\":0.94}\ncodex usage: input_tokens=85047 cached_input_tokens=0 output_tokens=832 reasoning_output_tokens=330\nfinding 0 uses invalid file path: /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/tmp/pr13-resume-20261014/efficiency-20261015/finish-20261017/acceptance-first/A911-10-source-transition-v1/provenance-correction-v3/actual-result.json"
